      "content": "i just can't see a version of the future where this works out. the shame is too much. i see my peers getting published and moving on, and all i see is this massive, pathetic failure. it feels like the \"real\" me was supposed to be this researcher, but that person is dead now. everything feels so heavy and final. like there's just no point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. it feels like the only decent thing to do is just... stop. stop trying to face the embarrassment, stop the struggle. it's just too much to carry.",
